      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds like you are experiencing a deep wave of disillusionment after putting in so much intense effort. Remember that technical mastery is just one small piece of a much larger picture of success. Instead of viewing this as a failure, try shifting your focus to what you *did* learn while grinding—those skills are valuable even if the immediate ranking isn't what you hoped. Allow yourself a moment to rest before redefining what \"breaking through\" means for you.",
