      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds like you are experiencing exhaustion from a relentless pursuit that has led to deep existential crisis. Pushing yourself forward when you feel fundamentally broken can feel like an elaborate performance, which is incredibly draining. Instead of viewing this as a single life that's over, perhaps you can see this period of realization as a critical transition point. What if the \"feast\" you sought is less about external achievement and more about internal alignment with your own definition of worthwhile?",
      "source": "target",
